::  name       tally max name len
::  shape      name-len - int (@u32)
::  invariant  every garden name fits in thirty-two bytes (max_name_len)
::  example    32
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend · Caravan · Mantra · Amphora · Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e192-tally-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e192 · nest-only Ashvini under Equinox B — second Tally Glow Tend limb.
::  Names max_name_len from tally/gardens.rye. Pedestal only; Rye still owns gardens.
+$  tally-max-name-len-shape
  $:  name-len=@u32
  ==
